g/t/p/w780/302FswmkEMEVp7lSBjBLs1oIFZm.jpg","overview":"On the outskirts of Medellín, Colombia in the late 1980s, local residents report strange lights descending from the sky. When a reporter arrives to investigate, a ragtag group of teens from a lawless neighbourhood storm the scene and steal his camera. In the hands of its new owners, the device records a mesmerising plunge into their frantic existence.","kind":"movie","rating":10,"certification":null,"runtime":84},{"id":"cmrhwaxvp00lgns75n83virvc","title":"The Locket","subtitle":"2025 • 12","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMDWNuae3c11bsv9PkcPSc8BtQl.jpg","backdropUrl":null,"overview":"People from different eras of time are transported to the present day by this strange locket passed through the generations. How do they return and if not can they cope in their new environment?","kind":"movie","rating":10,"certification":"12","runtime":7},{"id":"cmrhwdos300sdns75nrdgcmh7","title":"Manipulation","subtitle":"2026 • 16","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1x4hItxtqWdzmxeTypyLNIuOwnz.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4t2Yhj1Dwkp4YutxySurHIkr4cC.jpg","overview":null,"kind":"movie","rating":10,"certification":"16","runtime":0},{"id":"cmrhwjv21017qns75os2xdt21","title":"ASLEEP","subtitle":"2025 • NR","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Fkv7EoGEaYSPpDigkB6lsL0ajQ.jpg","backdropUrl":null,"overview":"A depressed girl daydreams of being abducted by aliens to escape her mental torment.","kind":"movie","rating":10,"certification":"NR","runtime":3},{"id":"cmrhwa23e00j8ns75587ryc0q","title":"Devour","subtitle":"2025","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXi7bnFjNYKxUzI82wU2dt6rpBD.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mH4p9AFcadWTSUVkgVOODXkgays.jpg","overview":"A struggling all female metal band called \"The Virginia Bitches\" have a taste for blood and while on tour their van breaks down in the middle of nowhere. Seeking help they come across a town full o